message: >-
  To cite a specific result, use the CITATION.cff file in its directory under results/.
  To cite the archive as a whole, use the metadata below.
title: "AxiomForge Mathematics"
abstract: >-
  An archive of self-contained mathematical contributions, each with a conventional
  manuscript, a Lean 4 formalization verified against a pinned Mathlib, and a disclosure
  of the role of AI systems in the research.
